        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.091,
            0.093,
            0.642,
            0.135
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 5' CGCGTTATAAA 3'; b. 5' CGCGUUAUAAA 3';\nc. 5' AAATATTGCGC 3'; d. 5' UUUAUAAGCGC 3'"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.093,
            0.156,
            0.546,
            0.178
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 酶的竞争性抑制动力学的特点是____。"
