        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.09,
            0.18,
            0.651,
            0.222
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a.Km值增大，Vmax减小；b.Km值减小，Vmax增大；c.Km值增大，Vmax不变；d.Km值减小，Vmax增大"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.091,
            0.244,
            0.592,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. 丙酮酸脱氢酶中的辅因子不包含的是____。"
